um museu de lata.

91
00:09:09,999 --> 00:09:12,467
O Guggenheim.

92
00:09:13,737 --> 00:09:15,236
Um, pai.

93
00:09:35,057 --> 00:09:38,026
Pai?

94
00:09:38,061 --> 00:09:39,894
Eva?

95
00:09:39,929 --> 00:09:41,262
<i>E aí?</i>

96
00:09:41,297 --> 00:09:43,498
Não tem nada.

97
00:09:46,769 --> 00:09:47,769
