133
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,520
Revela o caráter,
tem razão.

134
00:12:52,555 --> 00:12:53,655
Sim, revela o caráter.

135
00:12:53,656 --> 00:12:54,655
Eu te falei, sabe?

136
00:12:54,656 --> 00:12:55,655
Gente querendo
alguma coisa por nada

137
00:12:55,656 --> 00:12:57,492
