214
00:16:46,622 --> 00:16:47,455
- Vemos?
- Sim.

215
00:16:47,456 --> 00:16:48,623
Tudo bem.

216
00:16:48,624 --> 00:16:50,157
- Tchau.
- Tchau.

217
